 reach EOL in October 2024.\r\n\r\n#### :mega: Release Highlights\r\n- Added support for OS-agnostic baseline files ([#586])\r\n\r\n#### :tada: New Features\r\n- Added a detector for IP addresses ([#692])\r\n- Added a detector for GitLab tokens ([#782])\r\n- Added a detector for Telegram tokens ([#808])\r\n- Added a detector for Pypi and TestPypi tokens ([#819])\r\n- Added a detector for OpenAI tokens ([#823])","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Yelp/detect-secrets/releases/154450783/reactions","total_count":5,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":5,"rocket":0,"eyes":0}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Yelp/detect-secrets/releases/79081785","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Yelp/detect-secrets/releases/79081785/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/Yelp/detect-secrets/releases/79081785/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/Yelp/detect-secrets/releases/tag/v1.4.0","id":79081785,"author":{"login":"lorenzodb1","id":16848175,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2ODQ4MTc1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16848175?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lorenzodb1","html_url":"https://github.com/lorenzodb1","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lorenzodb1/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lorenzodb1/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lorenzodb1/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lorenzodb1/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lorenzodb1/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lorenzodb1/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lorenzodb1/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lorenzodb1/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lorenzodb1/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"node_id":"RE_kwDOBr3yYs4EtrE5","tag_name":"v1.4.0","target_commitish":"master","name":"v1.4.0","draft":false,"immutable":false,"prerelease":false,"created_at":"2022-10-04T19:43:39Z","updated_at":"2022-10-05T17:13:10Z","published_at":"2022-10-05T17:13:10Z","assets":[],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Yelp/detect-secrets/tarball/v1.4.0","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Yelp/detect-secrets/zipball/v1.4.0","body":"#### :newspaper: News\r\n- We're dropping support for Python 3.6 starting v1.5.0! Python 3.6 reached EOL on December 23, 2021 and, therefore, is currently unsupported. We hope this announcement gives you plenty of time to upgrade your project, if needed.\r\n\r\n#### :mega: Release Highlights\r\n- Improved filtering by excluding secrets that have already been detected by a regex-based detector ([#612])\r\n- Added a detector for Discord bot tokens ([#614])\r\n- Improved the audit report to make it easier to parse programmatically ([#619])\r\n- Added support for .NET packages.lock.json files in the heuristic filter ([#593])","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Yelp/detect-secrets/releases/79081785/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Yelp/detect-secrets/releases/72627540","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Yelp/detect-secrets/releases/72627540/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/Yelp/detect-secrets/releases/72627540/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/Yelp/detect-secrets/releases/tag/v1.3.0","id":72627540,"author":{"login":"jpdakran","id":15152203,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1MTUyMjAz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/15152203?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jpdakran","html_url":"https://github.com/jpdakran","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jpdakran/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jpdakran/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jpdakran/gist